uot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;T_lim 120 초 초과 → 미션 폐기 (계약 7절)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9FB4CE;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=7;spacingBottom=0;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2346" y="909" width="510" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP0 완전 통합 상세_n_56" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px&quot; color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;aruco_detector   도착 확인&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;camera_fx_scale 1.7778 보정 — I-031&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;solvePnP IPPE_SQUARE · 1.5 m 게이트&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;발행 ▸ aruco/id · aruco/distance · aruco/pose&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;ID 불일치 → 재접근 · 늦으면 arrived_late&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9FB4CE;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=7;spacingBottom=0;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2346" y="1001" width="510" height="97" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP0 완전 통합 상세_n_57" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px&quot; color=&quot;#4B357A&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;navigate_to_pose  (액션)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;planner_server · controller_server&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;velocity_smoother → cmd_vel&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt