C 안에서만 오간다&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D6B685;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=7;spacingBottom=0;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1566" y="3200" width="450" height="67" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP0-B 완전 통합 상세 (번외)_n_137" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px&quot; color=&quot;#1B4F91&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;/fleet/status · /fleet/mission&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;/fleet/intervention · /fleet/zone_event&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;FleetStatus 1 Hz · Mission · Intervention · String&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#3576C8;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=7;spacingBottom=0;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1612" y="3289" width="358" height="67" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="STEP0-B 완전 통합 상세 (번외)_n_138" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;line-height:19px&quot; color=&quot;#8A4F0B&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;kpi_logger   (상시)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;상태 · 미션 · 개입 · 구역 이벤트를 구독한다&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;거르지 않고 받아적는다 — 판정은 리포트에서&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;line-height:15px&quot; color=&quot;#3A3E46&quot;&gt;전부 ROS 시각 기준&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D6B685;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;spacingTop=7;spacingBottom=0;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR;fontSize=11;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent